{"content":"To find the percent of the total TDRs that was associated with commercial loans in 2012, we need to use the following relationship:\n\n1. Identify the total TDRs in 2012.\n2. Identify the TDRs associated with commercial loans in 2012.\n3. Calculate the percentage of commercial TDRs relative to the total TDRs.\n\nFrom the numeric catalog:\n- Total TDRs in 2012: $2859 million (source: t3c1n0)\n- TDRs associated with commercial loans in 2012: $541 million (source: t2c1n0)\n\nThe formula to calculate the percentage is:\n\\[ \\text{Percentage} = \\left( \\frac{\\text{TDRs associated with commercial loans}}{\\text{Total TDRs}} \\right) \\times 100 \\]\n\nNow, let's calculate this using the calculate tool.\n```json\n{\n  \"message\": \"Calculating the percentage of TDRs associated with commercial loans in 2012.\",\n  \"tool\": \"calculate\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"expression\": \"(541 / 2859) * 100\",\n    \"variables\": {\n      \"541\": {\"value\": 541, \"source\": \"source:t2c1n0\", \"unit\": \"million\"},\n      \"2859\": {\"value\": 2859, \"source\": \"source:t3c1n0\", \"unit\": \"million\"}\n    },\n    \"sources\": {\n      \"541\": \"source:t2c1n0\",\n      \"2859\": \"source:t3c1n0\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```","elapsed_seconds":11.558975792024285,"finish_reason":"stop","generated_token_count":382,"generated_token_ids":[1249,1477,279,3266,315,279,2790,350,7687,82,429,572,5815,448,8353,16606,304,220,17,15,16,17,11,582,1184,311,990,279,2701,5025,1447,16,13,64547,279,2790,350,7687,82,304,220,17,15,16,17,624,17,13,64547,279,350,7687,82,5815,448,8353,16606,304,220,17,15,16,17,624,18,13,20517,279,11414,315,8353,350,7687,82,8674,311,279,2790,350,7687,82,382,3830,279,24064,16403,510,12,10657,350,7687,82,304,220,17,15,16,17,25,400,17,23,20,24,3526,320,2427,25,259,18,66,16,77,15,340,12,350,7687,82,5815,448,8353,16606,304,220,17,15,16,17,25,400,20,19,16,3526,320,2427,25,259,17,66,16,77,15,692,785,14806,311,11047,279,11414,374,510,78045,1124,1318,90,36167,92,284,1124